  "description": "Duke Ron, who makes everyone nervous with his sensitive and prickly personality, is the only one among many maids who treats Joy specially. \n\n*\"It was only after you came to this mansion that I felt alive. I couldn't help but love you, Joy…\"*\n\nRon was saved by Joy, and he thought he would do anything for Joy. He didn't know why Joy came to his duke's mansion.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
